English:
instance [DeltaGeneratedSpace
  signature: X] :
  body: by
  rw [← IsGeneratedBy.generatedBy_eq (X := fun n => Fin n -> Real) (Y := X)]; rw [generatedBy_eq_coinduced]
  exact LocallyPathConnectedSpace.coinduced _

中文:
实例 [DeltaGeneratedSpace
  签名: X] :
